# Recursion 🔄

A function that calls itself!

## Structure

```python
def recursive_function(n):
    # Base case - stop condition
    if n <= 0:
        return

    # Recursive case
    do_something()
    recursive_function(n - 1)
```

## Examples

```python
def factorial(n):
    if n <= 1:
        return 1
    return n * factorial(n - 1)

def fibonacci(n):
    if n <= 1:
        return n
    return fibonacci(n-1) + fibonacci(n-2)
```

> ⚠️ **Always have a base case** to prevent infinite recursion!
